[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; Prototype Zero — Gate A asset and rig spike.
;
; This scene exists only to prove the registered KayKit import: coherent
; Knight / Graveblade scale against the dungeon kit, the medium-rig clips, and
; the handslot.r weapon attachments. It is NOT the calibration room, it has no
; navigation, collision, input, combat, or progression, and Gate B replaces it.

